WEBVTT

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:07.700
It looked as if Shigemori's old friend and
the Other World enthusiast, Matsudo,

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.760
had fallen into the clutches
of the Kokuboro.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.370
However, in reality, he faked
his own death to fool the enemy.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.950
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.820
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:29.020
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.920
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:34.360
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.770
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.300
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.640
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.310
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.810
Sha la la la la...

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:02.220
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.190
(Secret romance)

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:09.400
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.160
(A strange distance)

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:18.000
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:19.070
Yeah

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:22.540
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.150
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:31.480
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:03.610
I will make the Princess
the master of Karasumori...

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:08.010
Master? As in the deity of that site?

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:14.390
That may be the best way
to utilize that site's powers.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.360
I don't really care, but how do you
become the master of the land?

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.500
It's not like you can just jump in and say,
"Hey, I'm gonna be the master from today."

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.610
I hear you must live there
for a very long time.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:29.110
The Princess has said that
she lived here for a long time

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:31.840
and became the master of it
without knowing.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.210
Then I guess it's impossible.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.200
There is a way.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:40.680
The master of Karasumori
switched once before.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.190
Oh? That's a very nice
piece of information.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.100
We must search for the way to make
our Princess the master of Karasumori.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.830
Find it out in any way you wish.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.930
By the way, who's the current master?

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.530
That's still a mystery...

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.740
Aihi.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.920
You must focus on prolonging
the Princess's life.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:16.180
That's all you want me
to think about?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.120
"Don't do anything else"...right?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.960
As you wish.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:25.660
One of your worms is
inside me after all.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:30.300
I hold meetings so I can avoid using it.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.120
Your report to Byaku...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.180
about Haizen's group of four being killed
by the Kekkaishi is a lie, right?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.060
How did you know?

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.660
Because it's not like you.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.590
Aw, then I made it
a touching story for nothing.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.800
Don't tell such obvious lies.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.740
You kill your friends
just because they lack aesthetics.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:12.040
Now you're making false accusations...
I don't have any friends.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:20.960
Kaguro.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.650
You don't have Byaku's worms
inside you.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.560
What makes you think that?

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.290
You can lie to Byaku.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.960
Why are you an exception?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.800
I don't know. It's probably because
I'm stronger than him.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.830
You mind if I ask you one thing?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.070
Why are you always in human form?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.880
It's a sort of habit, I guess.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:46.870
A habit?

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.380
I was kept by a human once.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.580
I was forced to look human all the time.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.590
The only thing I could do was
observe other humans in the household.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.860
That's why I was able to research humans
more than any other Ayakashi have.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.430
You could've run away.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.330
They had cast a spell.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.900
I was unable to take a step outside.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.840
What a sad story...

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:22.870
Like a bird in a cage.
And now this castle is your cage.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:33.030
Here Shishio-kun.
Eat as much as you want.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:34.890
Th-Thank you.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.360
Let me get some salad for you.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.230
Here. Have this, too.
It's delicious.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:42.530
Eat it while it's hot.
This is one of my specialties.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.540
Help yourself.
You're still growing.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.540
Oh, right.
I also recommend these pickled dishes.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.980
Dad, where's Grandpa?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.640
He's out right now.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:53.610
He said he'll be back a little late
so we should eat dinner without him.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.840
That's rare.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.980
But we have Shishio-kun with us today
so you don't feel lonely, right?

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:03.050
You mean you don't feel lonely, Dad?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.150
I guess so.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.820
Thank you for the meal!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:08.950
Thank you for the meal!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:15.060
What kind of dessert would you like?
How about some fruit? Or how about...

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.700
I'm back.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.240
Oh, it's Father.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.410
Welcome back, Father.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.650
What would you like to do for dinner?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.040
- I'm fine.
- Hey!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.480
Let me go home.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.350
Come on.
Stay until my dad is satisfied.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.050
Sumimura!

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.550
Oh, yes. Why don't you
take a bath while you're here.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:39.920
Yeah, why not.

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:40.650
Wha?!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:41.960
Don't be shy.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.870
I hate... baths.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.260
You don't want to take a bath
unless it's with Atora?

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.430
Shut up!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.930
Yoshimori, can you
go check on the bath?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.200
Sure.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.610
I see, Masamori...
You too, huh?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.980
I sent out about three Shikigami,
but no luck.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.520
I tried doing my own research,
but infiltrating the Other World is not easy.

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:17.420
Grandpa Shige has been
acting strange lately...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.940
Before, he was reluctant about
contacting my damn, stupid brother,

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.300
but he's doing it much more now.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:25.240
Is he that dependable?!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.910
Hot! Hot hot hot!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.080
Come in.
No one will bother us here.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.920
So what is it you
wanted to talk about?

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.080
Oh...

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:51.520
How is my big brother... as a chief?

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.230
Why do you ask?

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:58.140
I don't trust my big brother so much.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:00.700
But he's your big brother.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.380
You don't trust someone just because
they're related to you.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.800
Well...

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:16.320
But if the Kokuboro
attack with all their might,

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:17.810
the Night Troops are going to
get involved, right?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.520
So I thought I can't be picky
when that time comes...

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:26.560
If you say he's all right,
then I'll trust him this time.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:28.960
So how is he?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.570
You don't come across a great
person like him every day...

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.270
I... trust him.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.380
You don't doubt him at all?

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.340
Never.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.240
All right. I see.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.910
You got that pretty quick...

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.720
That's because I trust you.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.460
By the way, did you use
the conditioner after the shampoo?

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.590
Your hair is sticking up.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.060
Leave me alone!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.450
This smell! It can't be!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.120
Nice seeing you again.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:33.460
The other night was great.
I still remember exactly how I cut you.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.130
You!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.930
Do you remember, too?

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.270
How you cut your own big sister?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.230
Wha?

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.440
So how was it?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.800
Cutting your big sister.
Not bad, huh?

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:51.720
I think you belong with us.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.780
What?

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:58.720
You're the type that feels
pleasure when you wield power.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:01.490
I'm not the same as you!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.060
We are.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.960
You have the same smell as me.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.030
Damn you!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.500
See? You smell like blood.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.320
Come over to our side.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:37.290
You're free to do anything on our side.
And no one will ever betray you.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.520
Shut up!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.090
You're so stubborn.
Fine, then let me give you something nice.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.900
It's to thank you for
the great time you gave me.

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:49.530
It's an insect egg.
A loyal servant will be born from it.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.010
It'll look exactly like
the owner of the egg.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:02.080
I'm sure that your servant
will look very ugly!

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.660
But it will never betray you.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.880
This is stupid.
I should throw it away!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.740
I should throw it away.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.080
It's... my voice...

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:34.290
It's... your voice...
The voice from your heart.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:49.990
Hello?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.700
Hey, it's me. How is it going over there?
Anything unusual?

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.230
Not much has changed.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:11:59.240
Oh...

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:02.710
Chief... Um... Actually...

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:03.510
Hm?

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.480
The enemy came to me...

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.180
What?

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:15.020
The enemy knows about me.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:19.290
I don't know how they found out,
but they know about my past, too.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:21.730
I see. I knew it.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.290
You knew it?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.170
A number of things happened here too.
That's why I called.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:31.610
Seems someone is leaking information about
the Shadow Organization to the Kokuboro.

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:33.810
I have an idea who it is,

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.040
but it's difficult for me to
do anything about it right now.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.580
I see.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.980
These guys are reckless.
You have to be careful.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.480
I know.

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:45.710
Anything else?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.830
No. That's all.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:49.820
All right.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.530
Anyway, report to me if anything happens.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:56.830
I'm counting on you.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:00.630
Yes.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:09.240
Take care. Here!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.220
Y-Yeah...

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.220
Hurry up, Yoshi.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.260
You're late, Yoshimori.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.530
Oh, shut up.
This thing was heavy.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:29.260
Where's Shishio?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.300
I don't believe you!

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.540
You never know when
the Kokuboro will attack

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.510
and yet you brought
this enormous midnight snack?!

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:43.810
I didn't have a choice! Dad told me to
bring it and share with everybody!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.180
We're not on a picnic!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.320
I didn't bring any bananas!

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.890
I'm not talking about bananas!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.830
Everyone takes bananas on picnics!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:54.860
He's so dumb.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.390
Poor honey.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:02.290
They're here.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.920
Wow, it's a nice lady with a hot body!

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.620
You'd jump at anything.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.010
My head is splitting!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:48.040
The sound is echoing and getting louder.
I have to block it.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.880
K-Ketsu!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.250
You saved me, honey.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.210
I thought I was going to die.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.660
What is that sound?

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:02.830
I don't know. But it's dangerous
to keep listening to it.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.220
Ketsu!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.470
Ketsu!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.810
It looks like it's getting stronger!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:25.550
Look at that rock!
It's absorbing power incredibly fast!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.180
Ketsu!

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:33.390
We can't attack, we can only defend.
What are we going to do?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.360
I'll go again.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.330
Wait! You can't just charge at it
without thinking!

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.690
What are you doing?!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.830
Yoshimori! The bell!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.230
Oh, right.
Ketsu!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:52.710
Ketsu!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:53.970
Metsu!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:57.880
All right! With that gone, we can win!

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.590
Shishio, get out of the way!
I'll do it!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.550
Sis...

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.390
Shishio?!
Ketsu!

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:14.760
Metsu!

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.030
- Tenketsu!
- Tenketsu!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.170
Shishio, what's the matter?
You're acting weird!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.800
Nothing... Nothing's wrong.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.010
Really? All right then.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.640
See? You smell like blood.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.320
You can't wash it away.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.990
Blood can be washed off,
but not your sins.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:23.330
But Sumimura said he needed me!

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:25.640
People say things they don't mean.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:31.280
They'll run away the moment
they see who you really are.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:33.910
Stop...

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.910
Stop this. Stop putting
your hope in others.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:42.620
You've been betrayed enough.
Even your family abandoned you!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:43.750
Shut up!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.120
I will never betray you.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:07.370
Byaku! How dare you face me
after imprisoning me here!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.840
This is all for your sake.

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:14.210
I hate this gloomy place!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:19.890
If only these damned legs would move,
I would escape in an instant...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:22.290
I'm sorry.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.460
Byaku. Tell me a fun story.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:31.930
I'm... no good at...

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.400
Do it!

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:34.500
But...

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.940
Anything!
Tell... me...

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:41.050
...please.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:41.710
Princess!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:43.980
Aihi!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.200
The Princess is at her limit.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.540
Is it true that parts of the castle
are falling apart?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.020
It's mirroring the deterioration
of the Princess's health.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.010
I have a suggestion.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:21.840
Say it.

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:28.330
Why not take the Princess to Karasumori?
Her powers might quickly return.

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:31.800
Can you move the Princess from here?

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:36.330
Removing her from life support
won't kill her right away.

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.830
It's possible if we use a portable device.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.260
I see.

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.400
But time will be limited.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:48.080
It's possible only if you
can take over Karasumori fast.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.710
Can you make that device immediately?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:52.640
Yes.

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.180
Then I leave it in your hands.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:56.650
Really?

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:00.490
But make the device
so that I can use it.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:04.160
Wait! The device...
I'm the only one that can...

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.720
That's why I'm telling you
to make it easy to use.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.230
You can do it, right?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:09.800
Wait!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:12.600
Take me out of this castle!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.680
Don't overstep your bounds.
I am the one giving orders.

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:28.350
Hurry. We will depart for Karasumori
once the device is complete.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:38.290
I'm off!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:50.100
Shishio was acting weird yesterday.
I wonder what happened.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.710
What a noisy dog.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.560
Oh, you're gonna protect it?

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.670
I hate pet dogs.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.260
Don't you agree?

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.500
Chained down
and domesticated.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.210
They're pitiful things.
Just like you.

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:26.200
What?!

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:31.820
You're also chained...
by that Flame Tattoo.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.490
Aww, you ruined my human skin.

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:43.460
So that's what you really look like.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:49.700
You sound like a human.
You're disguising yourself as human too.

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:53.470
That isn't bad in itself.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.310
But doing that all the time
can be tiring, don't you think?

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:00.140
Join us and you'll be released
from the Flame Tattoo.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.050
You can live your life
just the way you are.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.040
Shut up!

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:09.420
Come on. Drop the tough guy act.
You know you want to come with us.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.580
No!

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:16.360
Then why didn't you
throw away the egg?

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:52.960
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:00.870
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.400
"What nerve"

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:06.780
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:10.510
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:16.890
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:21.920
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:23.860
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:29.130
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:32.660
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:36.770
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:51.260 --> 00:24:01.600
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
